# Target datetime for the Countdown Prelaunch screen (app/page.tsx).
# Format: ISO-8601, interpreted in Asia/Ho_Chi_Minh (UTC+7). Example below starts
# 2026-12-31 at 18:30 +07:00.
# Missing or malformed value is treated as "already started" (countdown shows
# 00/00/00) rather than crashing the site — see
# plans/261005-1528-countdown-prelaunch-screen/spec/countdown-prelaunch-screen/technical-spec.md
NEXT_PUBLIC_EVENT_START_AT=2026-12-31T18:30:00+07:00
